  "title": "REPAY to Announce First Quarter 2026 Results on May 4, 2026",
  "summary": "ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Apr. 20, 2026-- Repay Holdings Corporation (NASDAQ: RPAY) (“REPAY” or the “Company”), a leading provider of vertically-integrated payment solutions, today announced that the Company will host a conference call to discuss first quarter 2026 financial results on Monday, May 4, 2026 at 5:00pm ET. A press release with first quarter 2026 financial results will be issued after the market […]",
